  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "待在中控室  (Staying in the Control Room)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Worried that pulling Bu Xiaogu away might upset Li Mingji, Chun Yuqiao starts to head backstage himself, only to run into Stella's strict public-relations rules. Listen to the scene first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "坏了，这是不是惹着他了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "让林姐现在赶快派人再过去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我亲自去协调。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "公关政策规定，两周之内您不宜与明星艺人接触见面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天晚上您还是待在中控室里进行指挥吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谁定的政策？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐按照公司制度亲自核准的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "节目组有常备药箱，不用出去买。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我这就去帮您找药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "直播马上开始，全国观众都会看。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "坏了，这是不是惹着他了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Uh-oh, did that offend him?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "让林姐现在赶快派人再过去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have Lin Jie hurry and send someone else over right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我亲自去协调。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will go coordinate in person.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "公关政策规定，两周之内您不宜与明星艺人接触见面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Public-relations policy says you should not meet celebrities for two weeks.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天晚上您还是待在中控室里进行指挥吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tonight you had better stay in the control room to direct.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谁定的政策？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who set that policy?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐按照公司制度亲自核准的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stella personally approved it under company rules.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "节目组有常备药箱，不用出去买。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The show crew keeps a stocked medicine kit, so there is no need to go buy it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我这就去帮您找药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will go find the medicine for you right away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "直播马上开始，全国观众都会看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The live broadcast starts any moment, and viewers nationwide will be watching.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "坏了，这是不是惹着他了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "让林姐现在赶快派人再过去吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我亲自去协调。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "公关政策规定，两周之内您不宜与明星艺人接触见面。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天晚上您还是待在中控室里进行指挥吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谁定的政策？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐按照公司制度亲自核准的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "节目组有常备药箱，不用出去买。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我这就去帮您找药。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "直播马上开始，全国观众都会看。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Yuqiao keeps order backstage as the national live broadcast prepares to go on the air, while Xiaogu goes to fetch Li Mingji's medicine. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
